1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,941
Lucia stole eight pay envelopes. Every
one was empty, but the payroll

2
00:00:04,941 --> 00:00:07,000
guard had signed for cash.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,941
Jason wanted the ledger. Lucia wanted
the tray underneath it, where fresh

4
00:00:11,941 --> 00:00:14,000
pressure marks crossed yesterday's dust.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,278
She held an envelope against those
grooves. Eight employee numbers matched

6
00:00:18,278 --> 00:00:21,000
eight signatures, all written by one
hand.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,941
Jason said, Someone beat us here. Lucia
shook her head. Someone was

8
00:00:25,941 --> 00:00:28,000
